Left: sign · Right: its element · 🜂 Fire · 🜁 Air · 🜄 Water · 🜃 Earth

Reading

House 1 · Querent · Self
  Amissio — Weakness or loss of health; the querent is losing ground.

House 2 · Wealth
  Fortuna Minor — Money comes quickly, but is quickly spent; help from others.

House 3 · Siblings
  Via — Much coming and going; news, letters and short trips, but little settled.

House 4 · Home
  Populus — A crowded household or shared property; little change at home.

House 5 · Children
  Cauda Draconis — The end of a love affair or pleasure.

House 6 · Illness
  Conjunctio — Illness lingers, especially from two causes combined; recovery is mixed.

House 7 · Partnership
  Amissio — Good for love but poor for contracts; the case is lost. Stolen goods are not
  recovered.

House 8 · Death
  Albus — A peaceful passing; fair dealings in inheritance.

House 9 · Journeys
  Conjunctio — Journeys with a companion; meeting a teacher or guide.

House 10 · Honour
  Via — Changes in career or position; honours do not last.

House 11 · Friends
  Laetitia — Happy friendships and hopes fulfilled.

House 12 · Sorrow
  Laetitia — Relief from sorrow; secret enemies are overcome.
